; 10 mm circle with 1.6 mm parallel-line infill
; 4 total layers (base layer + 3 additional layers)
; Infill orientation alternates 0 / 90 / 0 / 90 degrees to create a grid
; Z step between layers: 0.175 mm
; Calibrated nozzle position is the LEFTMOST point of the circle
; All non-extruding XY moves are routed along the circle perimeter
; No diagonal travel moves cross the interior
; Relative XYZ motion; Allevi-style increasing E values; no homing
